<h1>Owner's Authority to Obtain Information</h1>

<p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><%= format_date(today, :long) %></p>

<p>
  I hereby authorize and direct representatives of <%= @company[:name] %> to liaise directly
  with the Seller's/Developer's Legal Department, and release to them all and any information,
  notices and/or correspondence relevant to my purchase of the land situated at the address
  below as and when required, to ensure the successful completion of both the Land Contract
  and the Building Contract to be signed by me.
</p>

<h2>Job Address</h2>

<p style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); font-weight: bold; padding: var(--space-4); background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
  <%= @job[:full_address] %>
</p>

<p>
  I acknowledge and understand that the signing of this authority in no way constitutes a
  relationship between the developer and myself in relation to the purchase of the dwelling,
  nor does it release me from my obligations to always communicate directly with
  <%= @company[:name] %> in relation to the building contract or any other subsequent
  paperwork associated with the building project.
</p>

<div style="margin: var(--space-8) 0; padding: var(--space-4); background: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #bae6fd;">
  <p style="margin: 0;">
    <strong>I acknowledge that the Owner's Authority has been thoroughly reviewed and fully
    understood prior to signing.</strong>
  </p>
</div>

<%= render "signature_block" %>

<div style="margin-top: var(--space-8); padding-top: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--color-text-muted);">
    <strong><%= @job[:full_address] %></strong><br>
    <%= @company[:name] %> | QBCC Licence <%= @company[:qbcc_license] %>
  </p>
</div>
